<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Mercury Asset Manangement.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Mercury Asset Manangement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued two million American-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on Mercury Asset Management Group Plc ordinary shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	06.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	13.JAN.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    500			 SPOT REF     12.39 STG</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>			 STRIKE PRICE    ISSUE PRICE</p>
<p>   CALL		12.50 STG	 1.08 STG</p>
<p>   PUT		 12.00 STG	 0.74 STG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
